{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22017","headline":"读史五首 三 · 白居易","name":"读史五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉日大江军，少爲乞食子。\n秦时故列侯，老作锄瓜士。\n春华何暐晔，园中发桃李。\n秋风忽萧条，堂上生荆杞。\n深谷变爲岸，桑田成海水。\n势去未须悲，时来何足喜。\n寄言荣枯者，反复殊未已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}